      "description": "Shopify: build your online store, sell anywhere, run your business\n\nDream big and build fast with Shopify, the ultimate commerce platform for entrepreneurs. Start an ecommerce business, grow your brand, and manage every part of your store from your phone. Whether you're making your first sale or scaling your business, Shopify gives you the tools to move faster.\n\nWHAT IS SHOPIFY?\n\nShopify is the ecommerce platform behind millions of businesses in 175+ countries. This app is your seller center: one mobile suite for your online store, marketplace and social channels, products, inventory, orders, and sales.\n\nPOWERED BY COMMERCE AI\n\nSidekick, your own commerce AI, helps you get more done, spot opportunities, sell more, and make smarter decisions.\n\nBUILD YOUR ONLINE STORE FAST\n\nCreate an ecommerce store that's built to sell, no coding required.\n\n- Add and edit products, from clothes to electronics, with photos, pricing, and variants\n- Update your store's appearance and organize products into collections\n- Manage domains, customer accounts, and the apps that power your business\n\nHOW DO YOU SELL ON SHOPIFY?\n\nSell wherever your customers shop: online, in person, in AI chats, on social, and across marketplaces.\n\n- Keep products, inventory, customers, and orders in sync across every sales channel\n- Sell face to face with Shopify POS or Quicksale\n- Reach shoppers where they already shop: AI chats, Shop, social, and marketplaces\n- Manage multiple store locations and sell across borders\n\nMARKETING, ADS, AND ANALYTICS\n\nFind customers, bring them back, and understand what's working.\n\n- Create marketing campaigns, promotions, and discounts\n- Track sales, traffic, and store performance in real time\n- Get instant notifications when new orders arrive\n- Manage customer profiles and segments, and message customers directly\n\nRUN YOUR BUSINESS\n\nShopify is used to run your online store from one business suite, so you're your own store manager, marketing manager, and inventory manager.\n\n- Fulfill, refund, or return orders in a few taps\n- Track shipments and deliveries\n- Scan barcodes and adjust inventory on the go\n- Manage staff, apps, and day-to-day operations\n\nGET PAID\n\nMake checkout easy for customers and keep a clear view of your money.\n\n- Manage payments, payouts, transactions, and cash flow\n- Give shoppers a fast, trusted checkout\n\nCUSTOMIZE AND EXTEND\n\nMake Shopify work your way. Connect thousands of ecommerce apps, from dropshipping to marketing, as your business grows.\n\nHOW DO YOU DROPSHIP ON SHOPIFY?\n\nDropshipping on Shopify means your supplier ships each order for you.\n\n1. Add a dropshipping app and import products\n2. Set your prices and publish to your online store\n3. Track every dropshipping order and payout here\n\nNo inventory to buy up front, so you can dropship clothes, accessories, or home goods.\n\nHOW MUCH DOES SHOPIFY COST?\n\n 3 days FREE then 3 months for just $1/month! Start with a free trial, then pick the monthly plan that fits, from your first sale to high-volume ecommerce. Cancel anytime.\n\nFOR ANYONE FROM ENTREPRENEURS TO ENTERPRISE\n\nShopify is built for businesses of every size, from solo entrepreneurs launching tomorrow to global brands selling everywhere. Start fast, sell more in more places, and grow as big as you want, all from one platform.\n\nDownload Shopify and start selling today.\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013 \n* Shopify has the best-converting checkout in the world. Study completed in partnership with a Big Three global management consulting company.",
